248
00:10:52.618 --> 00:10:54.620
Through the use of our skill to

249
00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.889
analyze data and give us what we need,

250
00:10:57.289 --> 00:11:00.192
as well as built-in skills to create spreadsheets,

